  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A parallel plate capacitor is made up of stair like structure with a plate area A of each stair and that is connected with a wire of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math>, as shown in the figure. The capacitance of the arrangement is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>, The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is _____ .</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/33650a16-f05e-4fce-8841-32e58b694a58-image.png\" style=\"width: 160px; height: 208px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "23",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/04c9326f-d20a-459b-819a-53adc765c271-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 128px;\" /></p><p>Here the system can be considered as three capacitors in parallel.</p><p>So, net capacitance is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mi>b</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>23</mn><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
